test('3613 两版魂印独立选择、觉醒种族值与两个第五真实开局',()=>{const variants=[];for(const soulId of [909,1825]){const a=structuredClone(source),b=structuredClone(source);a.selectedSoulId=soulId;b.id=900614;b.souls=[];const fifth=soulId===909?32045:37195,ids=[10127,10225,20030,20290,fifth],s=E.createBattle({wikiSnapshots:[a,b],wikiLoadouts:[ids,ids],criticals:false});assert.equal(s.fighters[0].soulId,soulId);assert.equal(s.fighters[0].pp[key(fifth)],5);variants.push(s.fighters[0].stats.maxHp);}assert.equal(variants[1]-variants[0],30);assert.equal(source.base.maxHp,170);assert.equal(source.souls.find(s=>s.id===1825).base.maxHp,185);});
